      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING OSAKA (1) was a Grade 5 winner two back then out of the placings latest at this track but moves to Box 1 this time where she has performed well. Likely to improve sharply this time. RHONDA'S RUPEES (4) is a handy dog who jumped from box 8 last time out and scored by 6 lengths at this track (22.52). Ran the fastest time on the program in his latest win. Has hit winning form and can measure up again. ZIPPING KLIMENKO (2) has some solid form under her belt and proved too strong last time to win by 2.25 lengths at this track in a handy 23.16 beating Rebel Energy. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in her latest win. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. FLYING STRATUS (8) did a good job to finish third last time out over 400m at this track (23.06) in a Grade 5, the second top-three finish on the trot.",
